<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    2980    935	66    43</p>
<p> Great Lakes    30910    839     996    19</p>
<p> River Points   17461   2993    2319    17</p>
<p> Southwest	18771   5708     237    18</p>
<p> Gulf Points    25959   6055    1534    39</p>
<p> Plains Area    38978   4848     149    18</p>
<p> Pacific NW     10225    833     unq    37</p>
<p> Grand Total   145284  22211    5301    21</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7278--</p>
